{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"PMID:41131028; PMCID:PMC12549814; DOI:10.1038/s41531-025-01173-y\",\n    \"title\": \"Neural signatures of turn-induced freezing of gait in Parkinson’s disease: insights from phase-specific cortico-subthalamic dynamics\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"published\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"ChiCTR1900026601_parent_trial_substudy\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"possible_overlap_BeijingTiantan_externalized_STN_ECoG_FOG_cohort\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"本文明确说明其为ChiCTR1900026601注册临床试验中、随机化及干预前外接电极记录阶段的子研究。存在较强的既往队列重叠可能。第一，Zhang等2023年研究（PMID:37017365；DOI:10.1111/cns.14155）纳入18例患者。逐项比较两篇论文Table 1，2023年研究的18例人口学及临床特征与本文19例中的sub01、sub02及sub04-sub19相匹配；本文另有一例52岁女性患者。两项研究均来自北京天坛医院，使用双侧PINS L301 STN-DBS电极、外接皮层电极，并在术后3-5天进行步态实验，提示18例可能重叠，但没有患者级身份确认。第二，Yin等2022年研究（PMID:35441231；DOI:10.1093/brain/awac121）纳入16例患者，同属北京天坛医院研究团队，采用STN-DBS及外接皮层ECoG、TUG步态任务，并与ChiCTR1900026601注册研究有关，可能是同一更大队列的子集。该研究与本文的具体患者重叠比例尚未确认。上述研究应作为可能重复使用患者队列的不同原始分析处理，不能直接视为独立队列重复验证。【turn526187view0】【turn902167search1】【turn902167search2】\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E01\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、单中心、观察性、患者内重复测量电生理研究；术后外接电极记录；Med-off正常转弯与同试次直线步行基线比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者；平均年龄65.2±7.4岁，病程9.8±3.1年，FOGQ 17.4±4.2。正常转弯为其中没有发生冻结的自然步行转弯。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 19,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"STN电生理记录获得于19例患者，但该项统计实际纳入人数未单独报告。论文称视频评定者在275个试次上达成共识，但Med-off和Med-on冻结/非冻结转弯数量相加为279，存在未解释的计数差异。Med-off有87个含冻结转弯和52个无冻结转弯，未报告独立FOG事件总数。植入双侧四触点STN电极及8触点皮层条状电极，但实际分析使用的contact及双极配对数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG患者中的normal turning；具体FOG运动学亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；临床OFF-FOG、ONOFF-FOG或其他药物反应表型未报告。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停用多巴胺能药物至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"所有记录均在DBS刺激关闭状态完成；术后外接电极记录，植入双侧PINS L301四触点STN电极；刺激频率、幅度、脉宽不适用。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米Timed Up-and-Go，包含直线行走、180°右转及返回行走；本结果为无冻结的正常转弯，转弯TurnStart为旋转开始后的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN局部场电位（LFP），相邻触点双极参考。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部LFP alpha频段功率谱密度（PSD），不是burst指标或跨区coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz。Multitaper PSD；每个转弯阶段采用1.5秒非重叠窗口。功率先除以该窗口1-80 Hz总功率，再相对于同一试次无冻结直线步行基线归一化。直线步行基线由至少8秒的无伪迹步行窗口平均获得。采样率2000 Hz。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Med-off正常转弯期间，STN alpha功率在TurnStart阶段相对于同试次Walk基线显著降低。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p=0.012；未报告具体效应量、置信区间及精确功率差值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"转弯阶段与同条件Walk基线的比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，采用Bonferroni多重比较校正。患者级有效样本数及试次聚合方法未明确报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者，样本量小，缺乏非FOG患者对照。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双名独立视频评定者，报告90.2%一致率并通过共识处理分歧，但未报告kappa或分类敏感度。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance and electrophysiological recording\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"采用双极参考及幅度阈值筛查，但未报告各患者最终保留的有效窗口数量及残余运动伪迹比例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"存在单任务和双任务、不同转弯表现及药物状态；未明确报告本项分析对认知负荷及步速进行调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个试次和转弯阶段来自同一患者；本项Wilcoxon分析的试次聚合和患者级独立性处理不够明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较使用Bonferroni校正，但所有脑区、频段及不同分析家族的总体校正情况未明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"样本较小；本项为组内观察性比较，没有独立队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"报告了临床试验注册号，但没有充分提供本电生理子研究的预设分析方案以核对全部结局。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants；Statistical analysis\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是正常转弯而非冻结事件的STN局部功率发现，不能直接解释为FOG期间STN局部alpha异常。论文未提供该比较的具体效应量和分析样本数。研究作者指出样本量小、触点覆盖存在个体差异。\",\n      \"quote\": \"During normal turning, a significant decrease in the alpha band power was observed in the STN during the TurnStart phase (p = 0.012).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Phase-specific neural oscillations during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 2B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E02\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、单中心、观察性、患者内重复测量电生理研究；Med-off正常转弯期间STN局部beta功率比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG的晚期PD患者；本项为无冻结正常转弯。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 19,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"实际统计人数和有效试次数未报告；STN记录获得于19例。Med-off有52个无冻结转弯。275个共识试次与279个转弯状态计数不一致。实际分析contact数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"normal turning；FOG患者的非冻结转弯，FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧PINS L301四触点STN电极外接记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG自然直线步行及180°右转；无冻结正常转弯。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部beta频段PSD功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta 13-35 Hz；Multitaper PSD；1.5秒非重叠阶段窗口；同试次无冻结直线步行基线；功率归一化至1-80 Hz总功率并相对于Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Fig. 2B图注报告正常转弯时除已报告的显著变化外，其他脑区或频段相对于Walk没有显著差异。因此STN beta功率未报告显著的阶段性变化。该结果为图注级阴性证据，没有单独给出STN beta统计量。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告显著差异；具体p值、效应量和置信区间未报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；STN beta具体统计量未提供。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者，样本量小。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"正常转弯由视频评定及冻结指数辅助分类，但未报告kappa。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"有伪迹阈值筛查，但未报告有效窗口及排除数量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单任务和双任务条件可能混合，未明确报告步速及认知负荷调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个试次嵌套于患者，具体统计聚合方法未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较采用Bonferroni，但完整分析家族校正不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单队列小样本，没有独立验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"STN beta阴性结果只有图注级报告，未提供独立统计量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Fig. 2B\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"阴性结果来自Fig. 2B图注，未提供STN beta的独立p值或效应量；不能据此推断冻结转弯期间STN beta也没有变化。\",\n      \"quote\": \"No significant differences in other regions or frequency bands were observed compared to Walk.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Phase-specific neural oscillations during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 2B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E03\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、单中心、观察性电生理研究；Med-off正常转弯的皮层-STN功能连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD临床显著FOG患者；PMC和STN均有记录的患者数分别为18及19。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 18,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例，但该连接分析的实际统计n及伪迹筛选后患者数未明确。正常转弯数量为52，不能替代患者数。实际分析contact配对未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"normal turning；无冻结转弯，具体FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN外接LFP记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的180°右转；TurnPre为转弯开始前1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"PMC-STN alpha频段coherence，属于跨区域耦合，不是STN局部功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet continuous wavelet transform；n_cycles=freqs/2；使用coherence实部；1.5秒阶段窗口；相对于同试次Walk基线归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"正常转弯时，TurnPre阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence显著高于Walk基线。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p=0.0045；未报告效应量、置信区间或coherence绝对值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；患者级统计样本量未单独提供。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，且仅纳入临床显著FOG患者。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双评者视频评定，报告90.2%一致率，但未提供kappa及冻结事件时间精度。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双极参考和幅度阈值筛查，但未报告最终有效coherence窗口数。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"任务包括自然步行和双任务，未明确报告认知负荷调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个阶段及试次来自同一患者，具体统计单位不够明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但全部脑区和频段的校正范围未明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"没有独立队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"没有充分公开本子研究的预设分析计划。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果来自正常转弯，而不是FOG事件。可能代表正常运动准备过程中的PMC-STN耦合，不能直接解释为病理性冻结信号。\",\n      \"quote\": \"During normal turning, significantly higher PMC-STN alpha coherence was observed in the TurnPre phase (p = 0.0045).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3A\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E04\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、单中心、观察性电生理研究；Med-off视频确认冻结转弯与Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 18,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Med-off有87个含冻结转弯，但实际独立冻结事件数、参与者级冻结转弯人数及本项coherence统计n未报告。PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例。分析触点对数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning freeze/turning-induced FOG；未区分akinetic、trembling-in-place或其他亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；术后外接双侧STN LFP及皮层ECoG。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG自然步行中的180°右转；被视频评定为含冻结的转弯。分析阶段为TurnStart，即旋转开始后的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"PMC-STN alpha频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence，使用实部；TurnStart为1.5秒非重叠窗口；相对于同试次无冻结直线步行基线归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在被分类为turning freeze的转弯中，PMC-STN alpha coherence在TurnStart阶段相对于Walk显著增加。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p=0.048；未报告效应量、置信区间及绝对coherence值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；确切患者及试次数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，冻结与正常转弯比较样本有限。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Patient characteristics；Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频双评者及iFOG辅助分类，但未报告事件级分类性能和冻结精确起始时间。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance；Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"有幅度阈值和双极参考，但冻结运动本身可能引入残余运动伪迹，排除数量未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务和步速可能影响冻结转弯及连接，未明确报告相关调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多次冻结转弯嵌套于患者，实际统计单位未充分报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但全部连接和频段分析的总体校正情况不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无独立患者队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供本子研究完整预设分析计划。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants；Statistical analysis\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"TurnStart是固定转弯阶段，不等同于逐事件定位的FOG发生时刻。论文未明确证明该1.5秒窗口与每个实际冻结事件时间重叠。该结果是跨区域alpha coherence增加，而非STN局部alpha功率增加。\",\n      \"quote\": \"During turning freeze, there was an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.048) during the TurnStart phase.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E05\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性、单中心、观察性电生理研究；Med-off冻结转弯的皮层-STN连接比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；M1记录获得于17例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 17,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"M1记录获得于17例、STN记录获得于19例；M1-STN实际统计样本数未单独报告。Med-off含冻结转弯87个，但独立事件总数未报告。实际分析触点配对未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning freeze；具体冻结运动学亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN LFP和皮层ECoG同步记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的180°右转；TurnStart为旋转开始后的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"M1皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"M1-STN alpha频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence，使用实部；1.5秒非重叠阶段窗口；相对于同试次Walk基线。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在含冻结的转弯中，M1-STN alpha coherence于TurnStart阶段相对于Walk显著降低。作者将该结果描述为M1-STN功能连接解耦。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p=0.043；未报告效应量和置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；统计单位及有效患者数未明确报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，M1记录仅获得于17例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance and electrophysiological recording\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频双评者及冻结指数分类，但没有事件级时间定位准确度。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双极参考及幅度筛查，残余运动伪迹和有效窗口数不明。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"自然步行与双任务条件可能混杂，未明确报告调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多试次来自同一患者，阶段比较的独立性处理未充分报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，全部连接与频段的总体校正不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无外部队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"子研究预设分析计划未充分公开。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是跨区域alpha coherence降低，不能等同于STN自身局部alpha功率下降。固定阶段窗口未必与每次冻结事件实际起始时间重合。\",\n      \"quote\": \"During turning freeze, there was an increase in PMC-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.048) and a decrease in M1-STN alpha coherence (p = 0.043) during the TurnStart phase.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 3B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E06\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；Med-off、同一转弯试次内的TurnPre神经信号与随后转弯冻结持续时间关联分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 18,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"线性混合模型实际纳入患者数和试次数均未报告。Med-off有87个含冻结转弯，但模型是否仅纳入这些转弯或还纳入零冻结试次没有明确说明。分析contact配对未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG；以同一转弯试次的冻结持续时间为结局；运动学亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；术后外接电极记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG，180°右转；TurnPre为转弯启动前1.5秒，结局为该试次转弯过程中的冻结时间比例。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"TurnPre PMC-STN alpha coherence相对于Walk的百分比变化；跨区域功能连接指标。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；1.5秒TurnPre窗口。变化率定义为(Walk值-TurnPre值)/Walk值×100；coherence采用Morlet wavelet及实部；患者作为随机截距。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TurnPre PMC-STN alpha coherence变化与同一试次冻结持续时间存在显著关联。Fig. 4B图注将相对于Walk更高的PMC-STN alpha coherence描述为预测较短的冻结事件；Results正文只说该指标预测冻结持续时间，没有明确写出方向。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"β=0.205，p=0.006；置信区间和绝对效应量未报告。方向依据Fig. 4B图注为较高TurnPre PMC-STN coherence预测较短冻结；正文表述较为笼统。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"试次级冻结时间比例作为结局；linear mixed-effects model，TurnPre及TurnStart神经变化为固定效应，患者随机截距。未报告模型实际试次数、患者数、置信区间或外部验证。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"仅19例单中心晚期PD患者，预测模型样本量较小。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants；Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"冻结由视频评定及iFOG辅助识别，但没有公开逐试次事件级标注性能。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance；Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"采用双极参考及阈值筛查，但未报告每个模型试次的有效窗口数。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务、转弯速度及药物因素可能影响冻结时间和连接，模型未明确列入这些协变量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition；Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"采用患者随机截距，但没有报告试次数量及更复杂的试次嵌套结构。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个脑区和阶段预测指标同时检验，未明确报告预测模型的多重检验校正。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"19例患者构建预测关联模型，没有独立验证队列或前瞻性验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors；Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供足够详细的预设模型方案及完整系数表，无法核对全部候选预测变量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"需要特别注意Results正文和Fig. 4B图注对方向的表述差异。作者使用的变化率公式为(Walk-TurnPre)/Walk，而不是TurnPre/Walk。没有报告模型纳入的具体试次数及是否包括零冻结试次，因此严格的事件级pre_FOG归类仍不确定。该关联不是因果证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors of freezing severity\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E07\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；Med-off、TurnStart PMC-STN alpha coherence与同一转弯试次冻结持续时间的关联分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 18,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"模型实际患者数、试次数及零冻结试次处理方式未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG；同一试次冻结持续时间；亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；外接双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的180°右转；TurnStart为旋转开始后的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"TurnStart PMC-STN alpha coherence相对于Walk的百分比变化。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；1.5秒TurnStart窗口；变化率为(Walk-TurnStart)/Walk×100；Morlet wavelet coherence。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TurnStart PMC-STN alpha coherence变化没有显示显著的冻结持续时间预测价值。与TurnPre阶段显著的预测关联不同，该阶段没有显著预测结果。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告精确β值、p值及置信区间；作者明确报告未显著预测。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"试次级冻结时间比例；linear mixed-effects model；患者随机截距；模型样本数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"19例单中心患者，预测分析样本有限。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频与iFOG辅助标注，但没有事件级标注性能。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"存在伪迹筛查，但有效窗口及排除比例未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务及运动学因素未明确进入预测模型。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"随机截距处理患者差异，但试次嵌套细节未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个阶段和连接指标进行预测检验，未报告全部校正情况。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"小样本且无独立外部验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未报告全部候选指标的精确系数及置信区间。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不能将该阴性预测结果解释为PMC-STN连接完全不参与冻结；它仅表示在当前模型及当前TurnStart指标下没有显著的持续时间预测关联。\",\n      \"quote\": \"increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors of freezing severity\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4B\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E08\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；Med-off、TurnPre M1-STN alpha coherence与同一转弯试次冻结持续时间的关联分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；M1记录获得于17例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 17,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"M1记录获得于17例，但该模型实际纳入人数及试次数未报告；实际分析contact配对未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG；亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN LFP与M1 ECoG外接记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的180°右转；TurnPre为转弯启动前1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"M1皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"TurnPre M1-STN alpha coherence相对于Walk的百分比变化。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence；1.5秒TurnPre窗口；变化率为(Walk-TurnPre)/Walk×100。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TurnPre M1-STN alpha coherence变化未显示显著的冻结持续时间预测价值。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告精确β值、p值或置信区间；作者报告无显著预测价值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"试次级冻结时间比例；linear mixed-effects model；患者随机截距；实际模型样本数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，M1记录仅获得于17例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频双评者和冻结指数分类，但事件级准确度不明。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"有幅度阈值筛查，最终有效窗口数未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"任务认知负荷及步速可能混杂，未明确调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"患者随机截距存在，但试次嵌套结构不完整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多阶段、多指标预测，完整校正未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"小样本且没有独立验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"没有公开全部预测模型系数。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"仅为特定阶段、特定连接指标的阴性预测结果。不能推断M1-STN在其他冻结阶段不存在异常。\",\n      \"quote\": \"changes in the M1 alpha power and M1-STN alpha coherence in the TurnPre and TurnStart phase did not show significant predictive value.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors of freezing severity\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4D\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E09\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；Med-off、TurnStart M1-STN alpha coherence与同一转弯试次冻结持续时间的关联分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；M1记录获得于17例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 17,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"模型实际患者数、试次数及是否纳入无冻结转弯未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG；亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN LFP与M1 ECoG外接记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的180°右转；TurnStart为旋转开始后的1.5秒。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"M1皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"TurnStart M1-STN alpha coherence相对于Walk的百分比变化。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence；1.5秒TurnStart窗口；变化率为(Walk-TurnStart)/Walk×100。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TurnStart M1-STN alpha coherence变化没有显著预测同一试次冻结持续时间。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"精确β值、p值及置信区间未报告；作者报告TurnPre和TurnStart的M1-STN变化均没有显著预测价值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"试次级冻结时间比例；linear mixed-effects model；患者随机截距。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理预测研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，M1数据仅获得于17例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频及iFOG辅助分类，但事件级标注性能未完整报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"伪迹阈值筛查存在，但有效窗口数量未提供。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务和运动学混杂因素未明确纳入模型。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"随机截距处理患者差异，但试次嵌套细节不完整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多阶段及多个预测指标的总体校正未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无独立验证队列。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供完整模型系数及预设分析方案。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"阴性结果不能证明M1-STN连接与FOG无关；仅表示当前TurnStart指标没有显著的冻结持续时间预测作用。\",\n      \"quote\": \"changes in the M1 alpha power and M1-STN alpha coherence in the TurnPre and TurnStart phase did not show significant predictive value.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Electrophysiological predictors of freezing severity\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 4D\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E10\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-on正常转弯阶段的STN局部功率分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；其中5例仅完成Med-off测试，Med-on测试可用患者数为14；具体有效信号统计人数未报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"表1显示5例仅完成Med-off，其余14例有Med-on测试；但Med-on各电生理分析的实际有效患者数和试次数未报告。Med-on冻结试次较少，因此神经分析仅关注正常转弯。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"Med-on正常转弯；患者临床FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-on，服用左旋多巴后1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN外接LFP记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG，正常180°右转；由于Med-on冻结试次数有限，Med-on电生理比较仅分析正常转弯。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部alpha频段PSD功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；1.5秒非重叠TurnPre窗口；multitaper PSD；归一化至1-80 Hz总功率，并与同试次Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Med-on正常转弯中，STN alpha功率在TurnPre阶段相对于Walk显著降低。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正文报告显著降低，但没有给出该阶段具体p值、效应量或置信区间；见Supplementary Fig. C。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；方法部分报告Wilcoxon signed-rank及Bonferroni校正；该补充结果的具体统计量未提供。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，Med-on可用测试人数进一步减少至14例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Table 1；Methods—Experimental design\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"正常转弯由视频评定及冻结指数辅助分类，kappa未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"进行了阈值筛查，但Med-on有效窗口数量未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"Med-on与Med-off参与者完成情况不完全一致，部分患者只有Med-off数据。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段和试次重复测量的实际有效统计单位不明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但完整多频段、多脑区校正范围不明。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无独立队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"补充图给出方向，但正文没有提供具体统计量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects；Supplementary Fig. C\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"Med-on分析限于正常转弯，不能将该STN alpha变化直接解释为Med-on FOG期间的信号。具体p值需查阅补充材料；本次没有取得补充材料中的完整统计表。\",\n      \"quote\": \"STN alpha power decreased during both the TurnPre and TurnStart phases.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": null, \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig. C\"},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E11\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-on正常转弯阶段的STN局部功率分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；Med-on测试可用人数为14，但有效电生理分析人数未报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Med-on分析具体有效患者数及试次数未报告；表1显示5例没有完成Med-on。实际分析contact数量未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"Med-on正常转弯；临床FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-on，左旋多巴服药后1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN外接LFP记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的正常180°右转；Med-on冻结试次较少，因此分析仅关注正常转弯。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN局部alpha频段PSD功率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；1.5秒非重叠TurnStart窗口；multitaper PSD；归一化至1-80 Hz总功率及同试次Walk基线。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Med-on正常转弯时，STN alpha功率在TurnStart阶段相对于Walk显著降低。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正文报告显著降低；该阶段的具体p值、效应量和置信区间未报告。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank及Bonferroni校正；具体统计量未提供。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"Med-on分析人群较小，单中心研究。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Patient characteristics\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频评定和冻结指数辅助分类，未报告kappa。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"有幅度筛查，但有效窗口数量未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"部分患者没有Med-on测试，药物条件样本不完全一致。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段及试次的具体统计单位不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"虽然阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但完整分析家族未明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"没有独立队列验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"具体统计值没有在正文报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Supplementary Fig. C\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"Med-on结果来自正常转弯，不是实际冻结事件。不能将其作为Med-on冻结期间STN alpha异常消失的直接证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"STN alpha power decreased during both the TurnPre and TurnStart phases.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": null, \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig. C\"},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E12\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-on正常转弯的PMC-STN连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例；Med-on实际有效分析人数未报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Med-on有效患者数及有效coherence窗口数未报告；5例仅完成Med-off。实际分析contact配对未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"Med-on正常转弯；患者临床FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-on，左旋多巴服药后1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；外接双侧STN LFP和皮层ECoG。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的正常180°右转；Med-on冻结试次较少，因此分析限于正常转弯。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"PMC-STN alpha频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence；使用实部；1.5秒非重叠阶段窗口；与同试次Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Med-on条件下，PMC-STN alpha coherence在转弯各阶段与Walk相比没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告具体p值、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；实际有效统计人数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，Med-on分析进一步缩小。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频及iFOG分类，kappa未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"存在幅度筛查，但Med-on有效coherence窗口数未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"部分患者没有Med-on测试，且仅分析正常转弯。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"试次及阶段的患者内依赖处理不完全明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较虽有校正，但全部指标校正范围不明。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"没有独立验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供每个阶段的具体统计量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该阴性结果仅涉及Med-on正常转弯；Med-on冻结试次数有限，因此不能认为FOG特异性的PMC-STN异常已经被药物完全纠正。\",\n      \"quote\": \"under Med-on conditions no significant differences between the turning phases and walking were found\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 5D\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E13\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-on正常转弯的M1-STN连接分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例临床显著FOG患者；M1记录获得于17例，STN记录获得于19例；Med-on实际有效分析人数未报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Med-on实际有效患者数和有效coherence窗口数未报告；5例仅完成Med-off。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"Med-on正常转弯；临床FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-on，左旋多巴服药后1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；双侧STN LFP和M1 ECoG外接记录。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG正常180°右转；Med-on神经分析仅关注正常转弯。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"M1皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"M1-STN alpha频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Alpha 8-13 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence，使用实部；1.5秒阶段窗口；与同试次Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"Med-on条件下，M1-STN alpha coherence在转弯各阶段相对于Walk没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告具体p值、效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank及Bonferroni校正；实际有效统计人数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，Med-on分析人群有限。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频评定及iFOG辅助分类，但没有报告kappa。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"存在阈值筛查，但有效信号窗口数未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"Med-on参与者数量少于入组人数，且只分析正常转弯。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"试次及阶段重复测量的聚类处理不完全明确。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"Bonferroni用于阶段比较，但总体指标校正情况不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"没有独立验证队列。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"补充材料中未提供完整阶段统计表。\", \"source_locator\": \"Supplementary Fig. B\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果不是Med-on冻结事件的连接分析，不能直接作为药物消除FOG期间M1-STN解耦的证据。\",\n      \"quote\": \"M1-STN alpha coherence did not differ significantly between the turning phases and walking.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": null, \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig. B\"},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E14\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-off条件下PMC-STN beta频段跨区域连接的阶段比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者；PMC记录获得于18例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 18,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"PMC-STN实际统计人数、各阶段有效试次数及冻结/正常转弯分层人数未报告。Med-off含87个冻结转弯和52个正常转弯，但beta连接阴性结果没有分别提供两组统计量。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning freeze及normal turning相关分析；beta连接阴性结果未在正文按冻结状态分层。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；外接双侧STN LFP和PMC ECoG。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG中的直线步行和转弯各阶段；正文未对beta连接阴性结果提供正常转弯与冻结转弯的独立数值。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"PMC皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"PMC-STN beta频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta 13-35 Hz；Morlet wavelet continuous wavelet transform；n_cycles=freqs/2；使用coherence实部；1.5秒阶段窗口；与Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"PMC-STN beta coherence在转弯阶段相对于Walk没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告精确p值、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"阶段与Walk比较；Wilcoxon signed-rank test，Bonferroni校正；实际统计n未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，PMC记录仅获得于18例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"视频评定有报告，但beta结果没有按冻结状态分别报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance；Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"进行了幅度阈值筛查，但有效窗口及排除数量未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务及运动学条件未明确纳入beta连接分析调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"患者内多试次重复测量的处理细节不足。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但完整多频段校正范围不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无外部验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"没有单独报告该连接的精确阴性统计值。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"论文没有分别报告正常转弯和冻结转弯中的beta连接统计量，不能据此断言FOG事件期间PMC-STN beta连接没有变化。\",\n      \"quote\": \"no significant differences were found between the turning phases and walking in any of the regions analyzed.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": null, \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E15\",\n      \"design\": \"观察性电生理研究；Med-off条件下M1-STN beta频段跨区域连接的阶段比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者；M1记录获得于17例，STN记录获得于19例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 17,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"M1-STN实际统计人数及有效试次数未报告。beta连接阴性结果没有按正常转弯与冻结转弯分别报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning freeze及normal turning相关分析；beta连接结果没有按冻结状态分层。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off，停药至少12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；外接双侧STN LFP及M1 ECoG。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG直线步行与180°右转阶段比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"M1皮层ECoG与双侧STN LFP。\",\n      \"measure\": \"M1-STN beta频段coherence。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta 13-35 Hz；Morlet wavelet coherence；使用实部；1.5秒阶段窗口；与Walk基线比较。\",\n      \"finding\": \"M1-STN beta coherence在转弯阶段与Walk相比没有显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告精确p值、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Wilcoxon signed-rank test；Bonferroni校正；实际统计n未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，M1记录仅获得于17例。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双评者视频分类，但该阴性结果没有按实际冻结事件分层。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"采用阈值筛查，但有效窗口数未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological signal acquisition and processing\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双任务和运动学条件可能混杂，未明确调整。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"患者内多试次重复测量处理细节不足。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"虽然阶段比较有Bonferroni校正，但总体校正范围不明。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"无独立外部验证。\", \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—Limitations\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供该连接的精确统计量。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"不能将未分层的beta连接阴性结果解释为实际冻结事件期间M1-STN beta连接没有异常。\",\n      \"quote\": \"no significant differences were found between the turning phases and walking in any of the regions analyzed.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Cortico-Subthalamic network dynamics during turning\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": null, \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E16\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性观察性患者内药物状态比较；Med-off与Med-on行为结局比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者；其中5例仅完成Med-off测试，14例有Med-on测试。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"行为结局的实际配对分析人数及试次数未报告。Med-off含87个冻结转弯，Med-on含15个冻结转弯；这是含冻结转弯数量，不等同于独立FOG事件数量。视频评定共识试次数与转弯状态计数存在275与279的差异。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG，实际自然转弯中由视频评定确认；冻结运动学亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；论文未分类OFF-FOG、ONOFF-FOG、ON-FOG或biphasic患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off：停药至少12小时；Med-on：左旋多巴服药后1小时。部分患者仅完成Med-off。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"所有实验记录时DBS刺激关闭；外接双侧STN电极，但本项结局为行为指标。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG，包括180°右转和返回行走；转弯冻结由同步视频评定，iFOG辅助量化。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"行为结局；同步采集运动学和脑电信号，但本项不是STN神经指标。\",\n      \"measure\": \"转弯过程中冻结时间占转弯总时间的百分比。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"iFOG定义为3-8 Hz冻结频段与0-3 Hz步行频段功率比；6秒滑动窗口，步长0.1秒，iFOG>3作为冻结判定阈值。冻结时间比例为冻结持续时间/转弯总时间。\",\n      \"finding\": \"药物治疗后，患者转弯期间冻结时间百分比显著降低。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p=0.0033；未报告绝对差值、效应量或置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Med-off与Med-on行为结局比较；Methods说明条件比较采用配对检验，但该具体结局的检验类型及配对样本数未单独报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，Med-on比较仅有14例完成测试。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Patient characteristics；Table 1\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"双视频评定者和iFOG辅助分类，报告90.2%一致率，但事件级敏感度未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Turning performance\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\", \"reason\": \"本项是行为结局，STN信号质量不直接决定冻结时间标签。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Freezing quantification\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"药物状态与任务顺序、测试可用性有关；5例没有Med-on测试。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"同一患者多个转弯试次，行为比较的聚类结构未充分报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"论文报告多个行为和神经结局，但未完整说明所有结局的总体校正。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\", \"reason\": \"本项为行为状态比较，不是预测模型。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"没有完整报告配对人数及全部行为效应估计。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"Med-on冻结转弯数量明显较少，且部分患者没有Med-on测试。该结果支持药物状态与冻结时间减少相关，但不能证明STN某一特定神经指标介导了这一行为改善。\",\n      \"quote\": \"reduction in the percentage of time spent freezing (p = 0.0033)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 5A\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E17\",\n      \"design\": \"前瞻性观察性患者内药物状态比较；Med-off与Med-on行为结局比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"19例晚期PD且临床显著FOG患者；5例仅完成Med-off测试，14例有Med-on测试。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 19,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 19,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"实际配对患者数、各条件转弯试次数及统计分析纳入人数未报告。5例仅完成Med-off。行为试次数存在275与279的报告差异。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"not_applicable\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"turning-induced FOG；具体冻结亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"Med-off：停药至少12小时；Med-on：左旋多巴服药后1小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"DBS刺激关闭；本项为行为结局，不涉及刺激参数比较。\",\n      \"task\": \"5米TUG及180°右转；比较两种药物状态下的转弯表现。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"行为结局；非STN局部神经信号结局。\",\n      \"measure\": \"转弯总持续时间。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不适用；转弯持续时间由运动任务及运动学记录确定。\",\n      \"finding\": \"药物治疗后，转弯持续时间显著缩短。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"p<0.001；未报告绝对持续时间差、效应量及置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"Med-off与Med-on条件比较；论文Methods说明使用配对检验，但具体转弯持续时间结局的检验类型和配对样本数未单独报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"观察性电生理研究；adapted_not_validated领域级评估\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\"domain\": \"样本选择\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"单中心19例，Med-on分析可用人数较少。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Patient characteristics\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"同步运动学测量，但未报告转弯起止时间测量误差。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\", \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\", \"reason\": \"本项为行为结局，不直接使用神经信号。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"混杂因素\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"药物测试顺序和完成情况不完全一致，5例只有Med-off。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental design and data acquisition\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"患者内多个转弯试次的统计处理细节未报告。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"多重比较\", \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\", \"reason\": \"多个行为和神经结局同时检验，整体校正范围不清楚。\", \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\", \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\", \"reason\": \"本项不是预测模型。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects\"},\n          {\"domain\": \"选择性报告\", \"judgement\": \"unclear\", \"reason\": \"未提供具体效应估计和配对分析样本数。\", \"source_locator\": \"Results—Medication effects\"}\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"转弯时间缩短不能直接等同于冻结事件减少。应与冻结时间百分比结局分开处理。Med-on冻结试次数较少，实际配对患者数未报告。\",\n      \"quote\": \"significant shortening of turning duration (p < 0.001)\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\"section\": \"Results—Medication effects on neural dynamics and behavior\", \"page\": null, \"figure_table\": \"Fig. 5A\", \"supplement\": null},\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "33edc99d-6329-4787-867f-fa451d6e5cea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T124020761485Z", "elapsed_seconds": 563.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:49:43.800912+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0045290426f7a5096f16ec213a3359337142599b1597ff6bb05d726a916c05e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T124020761485Z", "f